---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={`About La Jolla Martial Arts | Family-Owned Taekwondo Dojo Since 2008`}
  description={`Family-owned Taekwondo dojo in La Jolla since 2008. Discipline, respect, and confidence for kids, teens, and adults — delivered with humor, patience, and decades of mat time.`}
  canonical={`https://lajollatkd.com/about`}
  ogImage={`/assets/EMA%20-%20Post.jpg`}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
<style is:global>

    :root {
      --blood-red: #29BEE2;
      --deep-black: #0A0A0A;
      --bone-white: #F5F5F0;
      --steel-gray: #3A3A3A;
      --off-black: #141414;
      --light-bg: #F5F5F0;
      --light-bg-alt: #EAEAE5;
      --dark-text: #1A1A1A;
      --muted-text: #5A5A5A;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
      background: var(--deep-black);
      color: var(--bone-white);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .font-display { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; }

    /* NAV */
    .nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      padding: 0.75rem 3rem;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      z-index: 1000; background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .nav.scrolled { box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); }
    .logo {
      font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--dark-text); text-decoration: none;
    }
    .logo span { color: var(--blood-red); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links > li { position: relative; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--dark-text); text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em; transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--blood-red); }
    .nav-dropdown-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .nav-dropdown-toggle::after {
      content: ''; width: 0.48rem; height: 0.48rem;
      border-right: 1.5px solid currentColor; border-bottom: 1.5px solid currentColor;
      transform: rotate(45deg) translateY(-1px);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .nav-dropdown-menu {
      position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 1rem); left: 50%;
      min-width: 220px; padding: 0.65rem 0; list-style: none;
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
      opacity: 0; visibility: hidden;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(8px);
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, visibility 0.2s ease;
    }
    .nav-dropdown:hover .nav-dropdown-menu,
    .nav-dropdown:focus-within .nav-dropdown-menu {
      opacity: 1; visibility: visible;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
    }
    .nav-dropdown:hover .nav-dropdown-toggle::after {
      transform: rotate(225deg) translateY(-1px);
    }
    .nav-dropdown-menu a {
      display: block; padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .nav-dropdown-menu a:hover { background: rgba(41,190,226,0.06); }
    .nav-cta {
      padding: 0.55rem 1.2rem; background: var(--blood-red);
      color: var(--bone-white); font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      font-size: 0.75rem; border: none; cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease; text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: #1A9DBE; }

    /* HERO (matches index) */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh; position: relative;
      display: flex; align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--deep-black); color: var(--bone-white);
    }
    .hero-background { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; }
    .hero-background img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover; object-position: center 30%;
    }
    .hero-background::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(
        to right,
        rgba(10,10,10,0.92) 0%,
        rgba(10,10,10,0.8) 40%,
        rgba(10,10,10,0.6) 60%,
        rgba(10,10,10,0.4) 100%
      );
    }
    .hero {
      min-height: 78vh;
    }
    .hero-container {
      position: relative; z-index: 10;
      width: 100%; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 8rem 4rem 4rem;
      max-width: 1400px;
    }
    .hero-left { max-width: 820px; }
    .tagline {
      font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blood-red);
      font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(3.75rem, 9vw, 7.5rem);
      line-height: 0.92; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--bone-white);
    }
    .hero-title > span { display: block; }
    .hero-title .accent { color: var(--blood-red); }
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 560px; line-height: 1.65;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .cta-group { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .btn-primary {
      padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem; background: var(--blood-red);
      color: var(--bone-white); font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      font-size: 0.875rem; border: none; cursor: pointer;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-primary::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: -100%; width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent);
      transition: left 0.5s ease;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-primary:hover::after { left: 100%; }

    .btn-secondary {
      padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem; background: transparent;
      color: var(--bone-white); font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease;
      text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--bone-white);
      background: var(--bone-white); color: var(--deep-black);
    }

    .stats {
      display: flex; gap: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 2.25rem; padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    }
    .stat-item h3 {
      font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--blood-red); line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat-item p {
      font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* SECTION UTILITIES (matches index) */
    .section { padding: 5.5rem 4rem; position: relative; }
    .section-inner { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blood-red);
      margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
      line-height: 0.95; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .section-title .accent { color: var(--blood-red); }
    .section-light {
      background: var(--light-bg); color: var(--dark-text);
    }
    .section-light .section-title { color: var(--dark-text); }
    .section-alt { background: var(--light-bg-alt); color: var(--dark-text); }
    .section-alt .section-title { color: var(--dark-text); }

    /* about__ container pattern (shared with index) */
    .about__container {
      max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem; align-items: center;
    }
    .about__eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--blood-red); font-weight: 700;
      font-style: italic;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    }
    .about__eyebrow::before {
      content: ''; width: 40px; height: 1px;
      background: var(--blood-red);
    }
    .about__image { position: relative; }
    .about__image::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute;
      top: -1.5rem; left: -1.5rem;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      border: 2px solid var(--blood-red);
      opacity: 0.28; z-index: 0;
    }
    .about__image img {
      width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 42px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }
    .about__title {
      font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.02; margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
      color: var(--dark-text); text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .about__title em { font-style: normal; color: var(--blood-red); }
    .about__desc {
      color: var(--muted-text); line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .about__desc p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .about__desc p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .about__desc strong { color: var(--dark-text); }

    .master-quote {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--blood-red);
      padding: 0.25rem 0 0.25rem 1.25rem;
      margin: 1.75rem 0;
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 1.25;
      color: var(--dark-text); letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }

    .credentials {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.65rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
    .credentials span {
      background: var(--deep-black); color: var(--bone-white);
      padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
      font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .credentials span.accent { background: var(--blood-red); }

    /* TENETS (dark section, matches programs-grid feel) */
    .tenets-head {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 3rem; align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .tenets-head p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
      line-height: 1.7; max-width: 460px;
    }
    .tenets-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .tenet-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
      transition: all 0.35s ease;
    }
    .tenet-card:hover {
      background: rgba(41,190,226,0.08);
      border-color: var(--blood-red);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    .tenet-num {
      font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--blood-red); font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .tenet-card h3 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .tenet-card p {
      color: rgba(245,245,240,0.65);
      line-height: 1.65; font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    /* WHY GRID (light) */
    .why-intro {
      max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .why-intro p {
      color: var(--muted-text); line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .why-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .why-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--light-bg-alt);
      padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
    }
    .why-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--blood-red);
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }
    .why-card .icon-wrap {
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      background: var(--blood-red);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .why-card .icon-wrap i {
      color: var(--bone-white); width: 20px; height: 20px;
    }
    .why-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--dark-text);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .why-card p {
      color: var(--muted-text);
      line-height: 1.65; font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    /* STAT STRIP */
    .stat-strip {
      background: var(--blood-red); color: var(--bone-white);
      padding: 3.25rem 4rem;
    }
    .stat-strip-inner {
      max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem; align-items: center;
    }
    .stat-strip-item h4 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.5vw, 4rem);
      line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    .stat-strip-item p {
      font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.88;
    }

    /* CTA SECTION (dark w/ bg image like index hero) */
    .about-cta {
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--deep-black); color: var(--bone-white);
      padding: 7rem 4rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .about-cta-bg {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1;
    }
    .about-cta-bg img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      filter: grayscale(35%);
    }
    .about-cta-bg::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        rgba(10,10,10,0.88) 0%,
        rgba(10,10,10,0.75) 100%
      );
    }
    .about-cta-inner {
      position: relative; z-index: 10;
      max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .about-cta h2 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.25rem);
      line-height: 0.95; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .about-cta h2 .accent { color: var(--blood-red); }
    .about-cta p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      line-height: 1.7; max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    }

    /* FOOTER (matches index) */
    .footer {
      background: var(--off-black);
      padding: 2.5rem 4rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--steel-gray);
    }
    .footer-content {
      max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .footer-logo {
      font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .footer-logo span { color: var(--blood-red); }
    .footer-info { text-align: center; }
    .footer-info p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #6B6B6B; }
    .footer-info a { color: var(--bone-white); text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-info a:hover { color: var(--blood-red); }
    .footer-social { display: flex; gap: 1rem; }
    .footer-social a {
      width: 40px; height: 40px;
      background: var(--steel-gray);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--bone-white); text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .footer-social a:hover { background: var(--blood-red); }
    .footer-social svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .tenets-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .why-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .nav { padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero-container { padding: 8rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
      .section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
      .about__container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
      .about__image::before { display: none; }
      .tenets-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
      .stat-strip { padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; }
      .stat-strip-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2rem; }
      .about-cta { padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem; }
      .footer { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
      .footer-content { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; text-align: center; }
      .stats { gap: 2rem; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .nav { padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; }
      .logo { font-size: 1rem; }
      .nav-cta { padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-size: 0.7rem; }
      .hero-container { padding: 6rem 1.25rem 2.5rem; }
      .hero-title { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 11vw, 3.25rem); line-height: 1; }
      .hero-subtitle { font-size: 1rem; }
      .section { padding: 3rem 1.25rem; }
      .cta-group { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
      .btn-primary, .btn-secondary { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
      .section-title { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 9vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.05; }
      .tenets-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stat-strip { padding: 2rem 1.25rem; }
      .stat-strip-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
      .about-cta { padding: 3rem 1.25rem; }
      .stats { gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 400px) {
      .nav { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; }
      .logo { font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
      .nav-cta { padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.65rem; }
      .hero-container { padding: 5.5rem 1rem 2rem; }
      .section { padding: 2.75rem 1rem; }
      .stat-strip-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    }

    /* ===== Hamburger mobile menu ===== */
    .nav-toggle { display: none; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 5px; width: 40px; height: 40px; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 0; margin-left: 0.5rem; }
    .nav-toggle span { display: block; width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--dark-text, #1a1a1a); transition: transform 0.3s ease, opacity 0.2s ease; }
    .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }
    .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
    .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }
    .mobile-menu { position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; background: #fff; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transform: translateY(-8px); transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease, visibility 0.25s ease; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 0.25rem 0 0.75rem; z-index: 999; }
    .mobile-menu[data-open="true"] { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }
    .mobile-menu a { padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem; color: var(--dark-text, #1a1a1a); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-weight: 600; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .mobile-menu a:hover { color: var(--blood-red, #29BEE2); }
    .mobile-menu-cta { background: var(--blood-red, #29BEE2); color: #fff !important; margin: 0.75rem 1.5rem 0; text-align: center; border-bottom: none !important; padding: 0.95rem 1.5rem !important; }
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .nav-toggle { display: flex; }
      .nav-cta { margin-left: auto; }
    }
  
</style>

  </Fragment>
<!-- HERO -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-background">
      <img src="/assets/EMA - Post.jpg" alt="Eagle Martial Arts students training in La Jolla">
    </div>
    <div class="hero-container">
      <div class="hero-left">
        <p class="tagline">Family-Owned Since 2008</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title font-display">
          <span>A Dojo Built</span>
          <span>On&nbsp;<span class="accent">Spirit.</span></span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Eagle Martial Arts of La Jolla is a family-owned Taekwondo school where
          kids, teens, and adults learn self-discipline, respect, and focus —
          delivered with humor, patience, and forty years of mat time.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-group">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Claim Free Week</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <h3>2008</h3>
            <p>Dojo Founded</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <h3>40+</h3>
            <p>Years Teaching</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <h3>300+</h3>
            <p>Black Belts Trained</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- STORY -->
  <section class="section section-light">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="section-label">Our Story</p>
      <h2 class="section-title font-display">
        More Than A Sport. A <span class="accent">Way Of Growing Up.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="about__desc" style="max-width: 820px;">
        <p>
          Eagle Martial Arts opened its La Jolla doors in <strong>2008</strong> as a
          family-owned Taekwondo school with a simple idea: martial arts should
          leave you better than it found you — more disciplined, more respectful,
          more confident, and more focused. Not just on the mat, but at home and
          at school too.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every class is structured, skillfully designed, and intentionally warm.
          We welcome <strong>beginners, shy kids, restless kids, kids with ADHD
          or motor skill challenges</strong>, teens trying to find themselves, and
          adults trying to reclaim their strength. Our job is to meet each student
